'''Burgle Boss Cat (Retired)''' is a [[:Category:Special Cats|Special Cat]] that can be obtained from the [[Download Celebration! (Event Gacha)|Download Celebration!]] Event Gacha. He was added in [[Version 8.9 Update|Version 8.9]].

{{Cat Info
|ID = 504
|rarity = EX
|name1 = Burgle Boss Cat (Retired)
|name2 = Burgle Boss Cat (Prime)
}}

==Evolution==
Evolves into '''Burgle Boss Cat (Prime)''' at level 10.

==Strategy/Usage==
Burgle Boss Cat can effectively be seen as just a worse [[Thief Cat (Rare Cat)|Phantom Thief Cat]], as he is worse at clearing peons due to his infrequent attacks; additionally, Thief Cat is already situational as it is. In short, he can only really shine in those areas where Phantom Thief Cat would also shine, so only really up until the end of early-game. Unfortunately, Phantom Thief Cat can later evolve into Goemon Cat, who outclasses Burgle Boss Cat in just about every possible way, even before its Talents, rendering him useless, other than as a way to boost your [[User Rank]], or as [[Underground Labyrinth|Labyrinth]] fodder.

{{Job|Classification = User Rank Dump}}

