==Trivia==
*Prior to [[Version 15.6 Update|Version 15.6]], Burgle Boss Cat was exclusive to the Japanese and Taiwanese versions of [[The Battle Cats]]. In order to unlock him, you had to reach League 2 in [[The Burgle Cats]]. When done, a red gift icon would appear, which would give this Cat when tapped. With the shutdown of The Burgle Cats, this was no longer possible.

